WEBVTT

00:01:31.700 --> 00:01:34.060
Come, everyone! Stay and listen a bit!

00:01:34.060 --> 00:01:41.490
What you see before you is a normal box,
just big enough for one person to enter.

00:01:44.450 --> 00:01:47.690
There's no one inside.

00:01:47.690 --> 00:01:51.460
As you can you see, the box is empty.
It's just a plain, normal box.

00:01:51.840 --> 00:01:55.430
And yet, if I close the doors...

00:01:55.430 --> 00:01:56.660
Onii-chan!

00:01:56.660 --> 00:01:57.910
Well?

00:01:57.910 --> 00:01:59.880
There wasn't anyone behind it.

00:01:59.880 --> 00:02:00.980
OK!

00:02:00.980 --> 00:02:02.330
1-2-3!

00:02:07.400 --> 00:02:09.270
One moment, please...

00:02:10.140 --> 00:02:12.340
Chi-chan, you OK?

00:02:14.650 --> 00:02:16.810
OK, this time!

00:02:16.810 --> 00:02:18.420
1-2-3!

00:02:19.310 --> 00:02:21.370
A huge success!

00:02:21.680 --> 00:02:24.030
If you liked it, please applaud!

00:02:25.400 --> 00:02:26.950
How mysterious!

00:02:26.950 --> 00:02:28.280
Wow!

00:02:28.280 --> 00:02:29.760
Thank you.

00:02:29.760 --> 00:02:31.320
Thank you.

00:02:31.320 --> 00:02:36.030
If you enjoyed it, anything you'd like to give is
appreciated. Please put it into this basket.

00:02:36.030 --> 00:02:38.450
Even rice and vegetables
are most welcome.

00:02:39.030 --> 00:02:40.910
Money's even better!

00:02:41.240 --> 00:02:45.390
We appreciate your donations, everyone!

00:02:46.410 --> 00:02:50.370
<b>Episode 4
The Three Chou Sisters
Acquire the "Crucial Keys
to the Way of Peace"</b>

00:02:50.770 --> 00:02:52.780
Anything you want to give!

00:02:52.780 --> 00:02:54.240
Please!

00:02:54.240 --> 00:02:55.790
Put it into this basket.

00:02:55.790 --> 00:02:57.140
Do you have any money?

00:02:57.140 --> 00:02:58.570
Of course not!

00:03:04.620 --> 00:03:07.540
That trick you saw was just our warm-up!

00:03:07.540 --> 00:03:09.560
Next is the main act.

00:03:09.560 --> 00:03:12.550
Enjoy the three Chou sisters'
singing and music!

00:03:16.930 --> 00:03:19.900
The first song is <i>The Butterfly
Floats Through My Dreams</i>.

00:03:19.900 --> 00:03:20.870
Please listen!

00:03:48.390 --> 00:03:55.560
A whirlwind brushes through my bangs.

00:03:55.560 --> 00:04:02.670
The chosen destiny begins.

00:03:57.950 --> 00:04:00.860
If we don't get back soon,
Mom will yell at us.

00:04:02.670 --> 00:04:09.720
We're more than just for show.

00:04:09.720 --> 00:04:12.770
We can do anything...

00:04:21.890 --> 00:04:26.010
That was most enjoyable.

00:04:26.660 --> 00:04:29.120
Oh, thank you...

00:04:29.450 --> 00:04:32.820
It appeared you had some problems
when you were exiting the box,

00:04:32.820 --> 00:04:34.990
but your magic was splendid.

00:04:35.330 --> 00:04:38.720
If you know that was magic,
not just a trick,

00:04:38.720 --> 00:04:40.830
then can you use magic, too?

00:04:40.830 --> 00:04:43.860
Yes, just a bit.

00:04:43.860 --> 00:04:45.360
Who are you?

00:04:45.360 --> 00:04:46.970
What do you want from us?

00:04:47.510 --> 00:04:50.340
Don't look so scared.

00:04:50.340 --> 00:04:52.270
My name is Ukitsu.

00:04:52.270 --> 00:04:54.850
A mere passing magician...

00:04:55.930 --> 00:04:57.260
How about it?

00:04:57.260 --> 00:05:02.480
Since you've shown me something nice,
I'll show you a trick of my own.

00:05:09.230 --> 00:05:11.110
Wh-What's going on?

00:05:11.900 --> 00:05:13.970
These feel like the real thing.

00:05:13.970 --> 00:05:16.070
Such wonderful clothes...

00:05:17.870 --> 00:05:19.970
This is our song?

00:05:22.750 --> 00:05:24.870
So many people...

00:05:24.870 --> 00:05:26.460
I've never seen anything like this.

00:05:26.970 --> 00:05:29.520
This is an outdoor stage?

00:05:31.900 --> 00:05:35.460
Chi-chan, Renhou-chan, let's sing.

00:05:35.460 --> 00:05:37.390
But Tenhou-neesan...

00:05:37.390 --> 00:05:38.970
This is kind of strange.

00:05:38.970 --> 00:05:42.060
But our audience... Everyone is waiting!

00:05:44.620 --> 00:05:46.230
Yeah, let's sing!

00:05:48.210 --> 00:05:50.020
OK, let's go!

00:05:50.020 --> 00:05:51.310
Yeah!

00:05:52.890 --> 00:05:59.160
A whirlwind brushes through my bangs.

00:05:54.200 --> 00:05:56.020
Where are...

00:05:56.020 --> 00:05:58.280
Nee-san. Tenhou-neesan...

00:05:59.510 --> 00:06:01.170
Come back to us.

00:06:01.170 --> 00:06:03.750
Huh? Where's the audience?

00:06:03.750 --> 00:06:05.180
Get a hold of yourself.

00:06:05.180 --> 00:06:08.970
It was an illusion by that Ukitsu guy.

00:06:08.970 --> 00:06:10.310
An illusion?

00:06:10.310 --> 00:06:11.510
Well?

00:06:12.160 --> 00:06:15.580
Did you enjoy your short dream?

00:06:15.580 --> 00:06:18.110
Where are you?

00:06:18.700 --> 00:06:20.900
Chi-neesan, that's...

00:06:21.910 --> 00:06:25.600
That book is called <i>Crucial
Keys to the Way of Peace</i>.

00:06:25.600 --> 00:06:27.530
What's going on?

00:06:27.530 --> 00:06:31.110
Use that and make your dreams reality.

00:06:33.110 --> 00:06:35.770
Make our dreams reality...

00:06:46.880 --> 00:06:48.890
I need to pee...

00:06:49.470 --> 00:06:51.880
You're still awake?

00:06:51.880 --> 00:06:54.800
Nee-san, this book is amazing!

00:06:54.800 --> 00:06:59.860
There are all kinds of magic here that
I've never seen anywhere else.

00:06:59.860 --> 00:07:03.820
With this, our dreams will come true!

00:07:04.170 --> 00:07:10.780
I don't really understand, but staying up late
is bad for your skin. So get to bed soon, OK?

00:07:16.070 --> 00:07:18.120
I forgot to pee.

00:07:19.870 --> 00:07:21.840
What were you thinking?

00:07:21.840 --> 00:07:24.580
You spent all of our money
to buy those things?

00:07:24.580 --> 00:07:26.780
Renhou-chan, calm down.

00:07:26.780 --> 00:07:28.830
How can I calm down?

00:07:29.950 --> 00:07:31.820
That which is deeper than twilight...

00:07:31.820 --> 00:07:33.920
That which is hotter than
the flow of blood...

00:07:33.920 --> 00:07:37.410
In your name, the name of the
great being buried in the flow of time,

00:07:37.410 --> 00:07:39.750
I make a vow to heaven now.

00:07:39.750 --> 00:07:43.940
With your power and mine, I shall
make our dreams come true.

00:07:43.940 --> 00:07:45.280
Chi-neesan...

00:07:45.280 --> 00:07:47.320
Let it be so!

00:08:02.730 --> 00:08:05.340
It's pretty!

00:08:06.030 --> 00:08:08.300
But what is it?

00:08:17.880 --> 00:08:18.780
Well?

00:08:18.780 --> 00:08:19.690
Surprised?

00:08:19.690 --> 00:08:21.690
What was that?

00:08:21.690 --> 00:08:23.240
What's going on?

00:08:23.240 --> 00:08:24.520
Explain.

00:08:24.520 --> 00:08:30.600
I put a spell on this crystal. If you speak
into it now, it will amplify your voice!

00:08:30.600 --> 00:08:33.490
I used good materials to make
it, so it works really well!

00:08:33.490 --> 00:08:35.190
Really well?

00:08:35.190 --> 00:08:37.280
What good is it?

00:08:37.280 --> 00:08:38.710
Can't you tell?

00:08:38.710 --> 00:08:43.560
With this, no matter how big an area
we're in or how big our audience,

00:08:43.560 --> 00:08:45.710
we can ensure that they hear our songs!

00:08:46.740 --> 00:08:48.270
Amazing!

00:08:48.270 --> 00:08:50.050
You're great, Chi-chan!

00:08:50.050 --> 00:08:53.930
But how are you going
to get that audience?

00:08:53.930 --> 00:08:56.170
That's our problem.

00:08:56.170 --> 00:08:59.840
Don't worry! I've thought of that, too.

00:08:59.840 --> 00:09:02.650
Leave it to me!

00:09:08.050 --> 00:09:08.890
Hey!

00:09:08.890 --> 00:09:10.700
Aren't you cutting off a bit too much?

00:09:10.700 --> 00:09:12.910
Hey! Hey! Is this really OK?

00:09:12.910 --> 00:09:13.910
Hey!

00:09:14.240 --> 00:09:16.940
And then we cut it like this, too.

00:09:16.940 --> 00:09:17.850
See?

00:09:17.850 --> 00:09:21.580
If you're going with that, then we
want to make this even shorter.

00:09:22.230 --> 00:09:24.830
That's right. We need to
show off our thighs.

00:09:24.830 --> 00:09:25.650
But...

00:09:25.650 --> 00:09:26.760
Everyone knows that.

00:09:26.760 --> 00:09:27.780
Really?

00:09:27.780 --> 00:09:29.050
Let's do our best!

00:09:29.050 --> 00:09:30.340
Yes.

00:09:30.340 --> 00:09:32.790
Include me, too!

00:09:38.400 --> 00:09:39.720
It's done!

00:09:39.720 --> 00:09:41.650
I'm done, also!

00:09:45.070 --> 00:09:46.070
Well?

00:09:48.010 --> 00:09:49.750
Then I'll do it, too.

00:09:49.750 --> 00:09:51.090
Wait, Chi-neesan.

00:09:51.090 --> 00:09:52.010
Me, too.

00:09:56.840 --> 00:09:58.730
Ta-dah!

00:10:08.340 --> 00:10:11.130
Aren't these outfits a bit
too short, after all?

00:10:11.130 --> 00:10:13.220
It's too late now!

00:10:13.220 --> 00:10:15.570
Tenhou-neesan, do you
remember your lines?

00:10:15.960 --> 00:10:18.230
Yeah, basically...

00:10:18.230 --> 00:10:19.920
We practiced really hard.

00:10:19.920 --> 00:10:21.480
It'll be fine!

00:10:21.480 --> 00:10:22.860
But...

00:10:22.860 --> 00:10:26.140
Anyway, we can't back out now.

00:10:26.140 --> 00:10:28.100
Let's do this!

00:10:35.240 --> 00:10:36.820
Everyone!

00:10:36.820 --> 00:10:41.290
The Chou sisters are about to
begin their song and dance!

00:10:41.770 --> 00:10:45.870
If you've got time, come listen to us!

00:10:50.020 --> 00:10:52.290
Everyone came this way!

00:10:52.290 --> 00:10:55.130
You called them over here!

00:10:55.130 --> 00:10:57.760
Tenhou-neesan, act like an adult.

00:10:57.760 --> 00:11:03.350
I can't! I've never been able to act
like an adult in my life!

00:11:03.760 --> 00:11:07.810
Tenhou-neesan... Just do
what you always do.

00:11:07.810 --> 00:11:09.240
But, but....

00:11:09.240 --> 00:11:10.610
Here we go!

00:11:10.610 --> 00:11:11.760
Wait!

00:11:11.760 --> 00:11:13.100
Start the music!

00:11:45.130 --> 00:11:52.080
A whirlwind brushes through my bangs.

00:11:52.080 --> 00:11:58.010
The chosen destiny begins.

00:11:59.180 --> 00:12:05.620
We're more than just for show.

00:12:05.920 --> 00:12:16.600
Let's throw away our cocoons,
with all the love we've got.

00:12:16.600 --> 00:12:24.140
Even if a mischievous cloud gets in our way,
we're not alone. We won't give up.

00:12:24.140 --> 00:12:33.520
Fly toward the sky of hope. The butterfly
floats through my dreams.

00:13:09.210 --> 00:13:13.210
We made more today than we
normally make in a month.

00:13:16.320 --> 00:13:19.890
At last... At last, our time has come!

00:13:19.890 --> 00:13:22.620
No, we're not there yet.

00:13:24.690 --> 00:13:30.920
Anyway, I didn't know you could use
amazing magic like that, Chi-chan.

00:13:30.920 --> 00:13:32.490
So true.

00:13:32.490 --> 00:13:37.630
She never did any real training. I don't know
how she could use that much power.

00:13:37.980 --> 00:13:40.550
That's not very nice!

00:13:40.550 --> 00:13:45.080
But to be honest, I don't really
understand it, either...

00:13:47.460 --> 00:13:50.530
When I have this book, <i>Crucial
Keys to the Way of Peace</i>,

00:13:50.530 --> 00:13:54.710
it feels like all the power
I need comes from it.

00:14:11.240 --> 00:14:18.440
A whirlwind brushes through my bangs.

00:14:18.440 --> 00:14:24.900
The chosen destiny begins.

00:14:25.480 --> 00:14:31.750
We're more than just for show.

00:14:32.660 --> 00:14:38.930
We can do anything, I believe it!

00:14:39.610 --> 00:14:46.390
Someday, we'll become strong,
beautiful butterflies.

00:14:46.390 --> 00:14:56.460
Let's throw away our cocoons with
all the love that we've got.

00:14:56.460 --> 00:15:04.400
Let's spread our wings and flutter away,
and awaken from the dream of a thousand years.

00:15:04.400 --> 00:15:10.730
Time is a kaleidoscope, and
its afterimages are jewels.

00:15:10.730 --> 00:15:18.180
Even if a mischievous cloud gets in our way,
we're not alone. We won't give up.

00:15:18.180 --> 00:15:27.290
Fly toward the sky of hope. The butterfly
floats through my dreams.

00:15:29.510 --> 00:15:33.400
There're mountains 'cause they're mountains.

00:15:33.400 --> 00:15:37.230
And if there're rivers, I don't care.

00:15:37.230 --> 00:15:40.890
If there're swamps, we
fall in up to our necks.

00:15:40.890 --> 00:15:44.700
And then a bear comes out and...

00:15:43.170 --> 00:15:44.710
Hey, Rin Rin!

00:15:44.710 --> 00:15:46.590
Stop shouting weird songs.

00:15:46.590 --> 00:15:47.710
It's embarrassing!

00:15:47.710 --> 00:15:49.420
What are you talking about?

00:15:49.420 --> 00:15:52.480
Everyone knows you sing songs
to keep bears away.

00:15:52.480 --> 00:15:54.100
That's what my grandpa said.

00:15:54.100 --> 00:15:56.910
There aren't bears in the middle of town-

00:15:58.270 --> 00:15:59.290
What's wrong?

00:15:59.290 --> 00:16:00.610
Are we under attack by a bear?

00:16:01.430 --> 00:16:03.760
No... Look at that.

00:16:06.110 --> 00:16:11.650
The super-popular three Chou sisters are
holding a performance here today...

00:16:06.910 --> 00:16:11.630
<b>The Three Chou Sisters</b>

00:16:12.220 --> 00:16:14.870
Who are the three Chou sisters?

00:16:16.060 --> 00:16:17.540
Never heard of them.

00:16:18.750 --> 00:16:20.500
You don't know them, everyone?

00:16:20.500 --> 00:16:24.440
They're the super-popular
song and dance group!

00:16:24.900 --> 00:16:28.170
Tenhou, AKA Choukaku, with
her easygoing smile.

00:16:28.170 --> 00:16:31.680
Chihou, AKA Chouhou, who gets
the crowd all fired up.

00:16:32.220 --> 00:16:36.590
And Renhou, AKA Chouryou, the smarty-looking
type with glasses.

00:16:36.590 --> 00:16:42.050
Everyone's talking about them.
They've been all over Seishuu!

00:16:43.510 --> 00:16:45.530
They're that famous?

00:16:45.530 --> 00:16:50.980
Come to think of it, I heard something like
that when I went into town to buy books...

00:16:51.530 --> 00:16:55.330
Since they're sisters, their dance is pristine
and their song is in perfect pitch,

00:16:55.330 --> 00:16:59.280
and the special effects, which Chouhou supposedly
does with magic, are amazing!

00:16:59.280 --> 00:17:02.460
I've always wanted to see them.

00:17:05.130 --> 00:17:08.070
And now we can see them on our journey...

00:17:08.070 --> 00:17:10.320
Um, Ryuubi-dono.

00:17:10.320 --> 00:17:16.430
Sorry to interrupt your fun, but we'll
never make it to Enjutsu's place-

00:17:17.290 --> 00:17:19.650
We're not going to see them?

00:17:19.650 --> 00:17:21.600
Well...

00:17:28.250 --> 00:17:30.500
F-Fine.

00:17:30.500 --> 00:17:32.010
Let's all go see them.

00:17:34.260 --> 00:17:35.460
All right!

00:17:42.340 --> 00:17:44.470
They're selling all kinds of things!

00:17:44.470 --> 00:17:47.410
Dolls... And those are dakimakura?

00:17:47.410 --> 00:17:49.870
They're selling candy!

00:17:50.630 --> 00:17:52.820
Looks yummy!

00:17:52.820 --> 00:17:56.820
Jeez... You always want to eat,
no matter where you go.

00:17:57.350 --> 00:17:59.420
That's why I'm cute!

00:17:59.420 --> 00:18:01.010
Don't say that about yourself.

00:18:04.230 --> 00:18:06.180
Yummy!

00:18:08.280 --> 00:18:10.270
It's orange-flavored!

00:18:11.540 --> 00:18:17.240
The sweetness of the sugar and the slight
sourness of the orange mix really well.

00:18:17.240 --> 00:18:21.910
Maybe they're using honey?

00:18:21.910 --> 00:18:24.460
Yeah, maybe.

00:18:24.460 --> 00:18:28.870
But it's kind of hard to lick them
when they're this long.

00:18:30.010 --> 00:18:34.100
Let's stop talking with our
mouths full, already.

00:18:34.100 --> 00:18:36.830
It's impossible to tell what you're saying.

00:18:43.860 --> 00:18:45.520
That's strange.

00:18:45.520 --> 00:18:47.270
What's wrong, Sei?

00:18:47.270 --> 00:18:52.560
Why is everyone holding that
candy and not eating it?

00:18:52.560 --> 00:18:56.440
Maybe there's no eating in the theater?

00:19:00.070 --> 00:19:02.420
It's time for them to start!

00:19:22.900 --> 00:19:26.360
Here we go!

00:19:29.270 --> 00:19:31.480
That was a really loud war cry!

00:19:31.480 --> 00:19:33.720
It's almost scary!

00:19:33.720 --> 00:19:40.710
A whirlwind brushes through my bangs.

00:19:37.990 --> 00:19:42.690
I see. That's what they're for.

00:19:40.710 --> 00:19:46.810
The chosen destiny begins.

00:19:42.690 --> 00:19:46.120
You weren't supposed to lick them
and make sucking noises, huh?

00:19:46.810 --> 00:19:50.790
Let's spread our wings
and flutter away,

00:19:50.790 --> 00:19:54.290
and awaken from the dream
of a thousand years.

00:19:54.290 --> 00:19:57.730
Fly toward the sky of hope.

00:19:57.730 --> 00:20:03.510
The butterfly floats
through my dreams.

00:20:06.160 --> 00:20:08.430
Everyone, thanks!

00:20:10.620 --> 00:20:14.130
OK, let's do the usual!

00:20:14.130 --> 00:20:15.810
Everyone loves...

00:20:15.810 --> 00:20:18.700
Tenhou-chan!

00:20:18.700 --> 00:20:20.230
Everyone's little sister!

00:20:20.230 --> 00:20:22.430
Chihou-chan!

00:20:22.430 --> 00:20:23.900
Very cute.

00:20:23.900 --> 00:20:26.350
Renhou-chan!

00:20:26.350 --> 00:20:29.830
Thanks! We got it perfect again today!

00:20:35.270 --> 00:20:38.790
Um, today...

00:20:40.150 --> 00:20:42.920
What was I going to say?

00:20:42.920 --> 00:20:44.250
I don't know!

00:20:44.900 --> 00:20:47.670
Tenhou-neesan, get a hold of yourself.

00:20:48.520 --> 00:20:49.960
Hey, what are you doing?

00:20:49.960 --> 00:20:51.890
What? You pushed me!

00:20:51.890 --> 00:20:53.370
You pushed me first!

00:20:53.370 --> 00:20:54.410
I did not!

00:20:54.410 --> 00:20:56.180
Shut up!
No, you!

00:20:56.180 --> 00:20:58.000
What?

00:20:58.000 --> 00:20:59.150
A fight?

00:20:59.150 --> 00:21:01.890
What's wrong?

00:21:01.890 --> 00:21:04.330
Don't fight!

00:21:07.900 --> 00:21:09.640
Enough!

00:21:10.190 --> 00:21:15.230
This is a place for everyone to have fun,
listen to songs, and see dances!

00:21:15.230 --> 00:21:17.960
If you're going to ruin everyone's
fun, then leave!

00:21:18.610 --> 00:21:20.590
That's right!

00:21:20.590 --> 00:21:23.050
If you're going to ruin our fun, then leave!

00:21:23.050 --> 00:21:24.450
Yeah.

00:21:24.450 --> 00:21:27.350
If you want to fight, fight outside.

00:21:35.250 --> 00:21:40.760
OK, let's get back into the mood by
going really wild on this next song!

00:21:48.130 --> 00:21:51.650
They were having fun today, too!

00:21:51.650 --> 00:21:53.500
Yeah, it was great!

00:21:53.500 --> 00:21:55.950
But there were problems.

00:21:56.810 --> 00:21:58.550
Yeah...

00:21:58.550 --> 00:22:02.560
But it wasn't a big deal, so it's OK.

00:22:06.590 --> 00:22:12.090
I'm happy to have a bigger audience,
but I don't know about stuff like that.

00:22:12.090 --> 00:22:17.280
But it's possible that if we don't do something,
there'll be more and more things like that.

00:22:17.280 --> 00:22:21.700
There won't always be someone
here to stop them.

00:22:21.700 --> 00:22:23.880
We need to think of how to deal with it.

00:22:24.560 --> 00:22:26.270
Deal with it...

00:22:28.780 --> 00:22:33.870
Let's spread our wings and flutter away,

00:22:33.870 --> 00:22:37.710
and awaken from the dream
of a thousand years.

00:22:37.710 --> 00:22:43.250
Ryuubi-san and Rin Rin-chan both really
liked the Chou sisters' songs.

00:22:43.250 --> 00:22:45.720
Well, it'll keep the bears away.

00:22:45.720 --> 00:22:47.470
It just might!

00:24:26.930 --> 00:24:30.980
Now, here's a question for you: What
religion did my sister start?

00:24:30.980 --> 00:24:33.730
A. The Way of Peace.
B. The Way of the Five Pecks of Rice.

00:24:33.730 --> 00:24:37.130
C. Seventeen-Year-Oldism.
D. Twenty-Three-Year-Oldism.

00:24:37.130 --> 00:24:38.950
Answer by the end of the preview!

00:24:39.300 --> 00:24:42.430
Next time on <i>Shin Koihime
Musou,</i> Episode 5:

00:24:42.430 --> 00:24:46.010
Kakuka and Teiiku come
into Sousou's service.

00:24:46.010 --> 00:24:47.940
Since it's my sister, it's C!

00:24:47.940 --> 00:24:51.470
...Is what we want you to think, but it's
actually D. Twenty-Three-Year-Oldism!

00:24:50.340 --> 00:24:55.010
<b>Episode 5
Kakuka and Teiiku
Come Into Sousou's Service</b>

00:24:51.470 --> 00:24:55.010
It's hard to find something
to say about that.

00:24:55.010 --> 00:24:59.930
<b>Watch us again, OK?
And rewatch this episode!</b>
